{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":0,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"16台就将近两个亿的价值量，翻倍。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":1,"status":"no_supported_item","reason_code":"conversational_utterance","items":[]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":2,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"第二个问题，表处理这一块，整个行业的竞争格局大概是什么样的？","semantic_type":"unknown","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":3,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"我们看到主要就是日本的三船和TEX，还有韩国的PNT。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":4,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"全球格局能不能帮我们梳理一下？","semantic_type":"unknown","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":5,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"您说到了三船，日本还有一家叫西工业，还有TEX公司，韩国的PNT。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":6,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"这几家我们都非常了解。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":7,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"国内的话，一家是我们，一家是洪田科技。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":8,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"国内你们应该比较了解。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":9,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"对。","semantic_type":"unknown","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":10,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"日本这几家为什么跟泰金没法竞争？","semantic_type":"unknown","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":11,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"我们做HVLP铜箔的设备，虽然还没得到完全验证，","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":12,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"但从设备原理上完全可以跟他们匹配。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":13,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"我们用的控制系统和传感器也基本能跟他们匹配，完全可以实现替代。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":14,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"铜冠是国内HVLP铜箔做得比较优秀的企业，前期一直用日本和韩国的表面处理机，导致国内企业不好判定哪家好。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":15,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"比如福建有一家铜箔企业，买了两台日本西工业的表面处理机，买了两台泰金的。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":16,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"泰金的做12微米铜箔正常开机没问题，西工业的连机都开不起来。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":17,"status":"no_supported_item","reason_code":"incomplete_phrase","items":[]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":18,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"不能只看设备行不行，还要匹配工艺和操作人员的能力。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":19,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"分析完之后，我讲一下西工业、TEX和三船的设备交期和单价。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":20,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"这几家的价格基本都在2000万左右，甚至更高，交期是6到12个月。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"},{"text":"但做投资的应该了解，市场不允许等那么久。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":21,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"如果定了六个月或一年才交货，可能行业已经不需要HVLP3或4了，已经到5或6了，你们的设备还能不能生产这个层次的产品？","semantic_type":"unknown","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":22,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"不一定能保证。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"negated","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":23,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"而我们泰金的交货期，一个月就能交一台，价格一千万出头。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
